A Appendix
A.1 Instruction-Tuning Training Task Inventory
Table 6 summarizes the training tasks at the task-family level. We group closely related tasks to keep the inventory readable; concrete task names are the dataset identifiers used by the data preparation and training pipeline. The scale column reports generated training examples after filtering and subsampling.
Table 6: Instruction-tuning training task inventory. Representative prompt templates are lightly normalized from the data-preparation configs; each task family uses multiple paraphrases during generation.

HCA, Training examples = 2.17M. HCA, Task families = cell type, tissue, cell-cycle phase, lineage, biological role. HCA, Output = cell type, tissue, phase, lineage, role. HCA, Example template = 'Given this expression profile, identify the cell type / tissue / cell-cycle phase.'. TCGA, Training examples = 97.9k. TCGA, Task families = study, tissue, tumor/normal status, stage, demographics, age. TCGA, Output = clinical label, numeric age. TCGA, Example template = 'Based on this expression profile, determine the TCGA study, primary site, stage, or patient attribute.'. GTEx, Training examples = 14.8k. GTEx, Task families = tissue of origin. GTEx, Output = tissue label. GTEx, Example template = 'Classify the tissue of origin from the expression profile.'. GEO, Training examples = 1.63M. GEO, Task families = sample descriptions, top gene prediction, metadata annotation, derived conversations and QA. GEO, Output = sample description, class, gene list, yes/no, natural-language response. GEO, Example template = 'Describe this sample from its expression profile.' / 'Compare the disease and control samples.'. DepMap, Training examples = 287k. DepMap, Task families = gene essentiality, including binned evaluation by expression context. DepMap, Output = yes/no essentiality. DepMap, Example template = 'Given this cell-line expression profile, is GENE essential for survival? Answer yes or no.'. Replogle / Nadig, Training examples = 123k. Replogle / Nadig, Task families = top expressed genes, knockout identification, perturbation response prediction. Replogle / Nadig, Output = knocked-out gene, ranked gene list. Replogle / Nadig, Example template = 'Given the control profile, predict the top expressed genes after knocking out GENE .'. BioMaze / STRING / Gene Ontology, Training examples = 1.04M. BioMaze / STRING / Gene Ontology, Task families = graph reachability, shortest paths, pathway completion, gene-set enrichment. BioMaze / STRING / Gene Ontology, Output = yes/no, protein path, pathway name, gene list. BioMaze / STRING / Gene Ontology, Example template = 'With these genes knocked out, what is the shortest downstream path from A to B ?'. DepMap / Cellosaurus / UniProt, Training examples = 212k. DepMap / Cellosaurus / UniProt, Task families = mutations, copy number, disease, lineage, anatomical site, transformant status, cell-line description/similarity, protein function/location. DepMap / Cellosaurus / UniProt, Output = entity list, cell-line name, short answer. DepMap / Cellosaurus / UniProt, Example template = 'Which cancer genes are mutated in this cell line?' / 'What are possible locations of this protein?'

